      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name}\n\nThanks for your response.\n\nHowever, this behavior did not occur in previous versions of VRChat.\n\nPreviously, clicking on a world thumbnail simply opened the world details page. It did not automatically create a new Public instance.\n\nSince yesterday, a new Public instance owned by me has been created every time I open a world details page. This happens with multiple different worlds, and the instance remains even if I immediately close the details page without joining.\n\nI also restarted VRChat, but the issue persists.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
